        "Description": "The GAMA Private Hospital has learned that Dr. Ito, &quot;the Curator,&quot; has kidnapped an interpol agent who was investigating his affairs. While GAMA has previous turned a blind eye to the Curator&apos;s &quot;unorthodox&quot; methods, they have now attracted too much attention to the hospital. \r\rGAMA has requested that the Curator be eliminated, as well as all evidence of the interpol agent&apos;s presence be removed. The incinerators in the morgue should be used to accomplish this.",
